@startuml
title ParkingSession 状态图（AI-辅助）
[*] --> ENTERING : 入场请求写入本地记录
ENTERING --> PARKED : 车位占用成功
ENTERING --> ENTRY_FAILED : 占位失败且补偿完成
ENTERING --> ENTERING : 补偿失败，等待同请求键重试
PARKED --> EXIT_PENDING_PAYMENT : 出场意图已冻结并持久化
EXIT_PENDING_PAYMENT --> EXIT_PENDING_PAYMENT : billing 故障，按原意图重试出账
EXIT_PENDING_PAYMENT --> EXIT_PENDING_PAYMENT : 模拟支付失败
EXIT_PENDING_PAYMENT --> PAID_PENDING_RELEASE : 账单支付成功
PAID_PENDING_RELEASE --> PAID_PENDING_RELEASE : 退款或释放失败
PAID_PENDING_RELEASE --> CLOSED : 退款与释放完成
ENTRY_FAILED --> [*]
CLOSED --> [*]
@enduml
